    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever or weight change</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No seizures, spells, headache, weakness or change in smell or vision</td></tr><tr><td>Musculoskeletal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Muscle aches after the seizure have gone</td></tr><tr><td>Genitourinary</td><td>Negative</td><td>Regular periods; not pregnant</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Worried about another seizure in public; PHQ-9 3; no thoughts of self-harm</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>5 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
